{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombie Hitler has been defeated, but the zombie hordes are still at large and Europe remains in the throes of war.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Following the story of Zombie Army, you return to the field as one of the Deadhunters, an elite squad fighting to end the apocalypse! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058030/extras/af0f1d171b930cf52f5191180418bb96.poster.avif?t=1756888870\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058030/extras/af0f1d171b930cf52f5191180418bb96.webm?t=1756888870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058030/extras/af0f1d171b930cf52f5191180418bb96.mp4?t=1756888870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VR brings a new level of immersion to the nail-biting action. Use both hands to aim down the sights of your rifle and dual-wield pistols and submachine guns when you get up close and personal. You will also need to master reloading drills as the undead masses bear down on you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The X-ray Kill Cam returns, allowing you to relive long-range kills in slow motion glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058030/extras/333db8f380e8fb623d5d2ad35f5e3f81.poster.avif?t=1756888870\" width=620 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058030/extras/333db8f380e8fb623d5d2ad35f5e3f81.webm?t=1756888870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058030/extras/333db8f380e8fb623d5d2ad35f5e3f81.mp4?t=1756888870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From zombie snipers to hulking armoured giants, your shooting skills will be put to the test against a multitude of horrors.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use an arsenal of authentic World War 2 weapons including sniper rifles, submachine guns, and pistols to fight the undead scourge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058030/extras/4a9e25face862ce70049b86215ecd1e4.poster.avif?t=1756888870\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058030/extras/4a9e25face862ce70049b86215ecd1e4.webm?t=1756888870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058030/extras/4a9e25face862ce70049b86215ecd1e4.mp4?t=1756888870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create the Deadhunter that fits your SLAYstyle. As you SLAY your way across a zombie-infested Europe, earn XP to level up your Deadhunter and use Weapon Upgrade kits to modify the range, accuracy, scope, and capacity of your weapons.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join up with a comrade to share ammo and medkits and compete to score the most creative executions and dismemberments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058030/extras/78c27a7af707f381c9a8786ab6d046d1.poster.avif?t=1756888870\" width=620 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058030/extras/78c27a7af707f381c9a8786ab6d046d1.webm?t=1756888870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058030/extras/78c27a7af707f381c9a8786ab6d046d1.mp4?t=1756888870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key features:\t </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tSpine-chilling campaign</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tAuthentic World War II weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tPlayer progression and weapon modification</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tSlay alone or with a friend</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Last Chance Saloon","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2058030/8d7d8ab46fb14942aca606651df18f03575fd549.jpg"},{"name":"Doomed Patrol","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2058030/a880b24e47a6a0f6b0e5e87c4c04eea4233e2bc6.jpg"},{"name":"Lab Rats","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2058030/9298bd120312253eaa34d5af0ac3bc031648bd0b.jpg"},{"name":"Death Knell Hell","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2058030/8cbb53b1ac680bc33b3ca650b727cd6a1260b24a.jpg"},{"name":"All Hell Breaks Loose","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2058030/5d6e6d6a808809420de138653e7615bbac0ded63.jpg"},{"name":"Invasion of Evil","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2058030/3323f98cd490ae3e257c740fea159b17ead013ba.jpg"},{"name":"Release from Agony","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2058030/79046f6fd50ef8fb0f517e1d57f81585c63f754b.jpg"},{"name":"In Good Hands","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2058030/8595684ba6a4d682fa35f3e68cd768bf8bea1ffd.jpg"},{"name":"Flesh Produce","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2058030/19269aaa8deb0e3349f9d59564ce5ef84da500f1.jpg"},{"name":"The Hands of Fate\t","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2058030/48a03f0c19e104518c871cba492374e1e5e6c54d.jpg"}],"total":37},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2058030?t=1756888870","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2058030?t=1756888870","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058030/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756888870","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058030/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756888870","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Zombie Hitler has been defeated, but the zombie hordes are still at large and Europe remains in the throes of war.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Following the story of Zombie Army, you return to the field as one of the Deadhunters, an elite squad fighting to end the apocalypse! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058030/extras/af0f1d171b930cf52f5191180418bb96.poster.avif?t=1756888870\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058030/extras/af0f1d171b930cf52f5191180418bb96.webm?t=1756888870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058030/extras/af0f1d171b930cf52f5191180418bb96.mp4?t=1756888870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VR brings a new level of immersion to the nail-biting action. Use both hands to aim down the sights of your rifle and dual-wield pistols and submachine guns when you get up close and personal. You will also need to master reloading drills as the undead masses bear down on you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The X-ray Kill Cam returns, allowing you to relive long-range kills in slow motion glory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058030/extras/333db8f380e8fb623d5d2ad35f5e3f81.poster.avif?t=1756888870\" width=620 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058030/extras/333db8f380e8fb623d5d2ad35f5e3f81.webm?t=1756888870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058030/extras/333db8f380e8fb623d5d2ad35f5e3f81.mp4?t=1756888870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From zombie snipers to hulking armoured giants, your shooting skills will be put to the test against a multitude of horrors.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use an arsenal of authentic World War 2 weapons including sniper rifles, submachine guns, and pistols to fight the undead scourge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058030/extras/4a9e25face862ce70049b86215ecd1e4.poster.avif?t=1756888870\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058030/extras/4a9e25face862ce70049b86215ecd1e4.webm?t=1756888870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058030/extras/4a9e25face862ce70049b86215ecd1e4.mp4?t=1756888870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create the Deadhunter that fits your SLAYstyle. As you SLAY your way across a zombie-infested Europe, earn XP to level up your Deadhunter and use Weapon Upgrade kits to modify the range, accuracy, scope, and capacity of your weapons.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join up with a comrade to share ammo and medkits and compete to score the most creative executions and dismemberments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058030/extras/78c27a7af707f381c9a8786ab6d046d1.poster.avif?t=1756888870\" width=620 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058030/extras/78c27a7af707f381c9a8786ab6d046d1.webm?t=1756888870\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058030/extras/78c27a7af707f381c9a8786ab6d046d1.mp4?t=1756888870\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Key features:\t </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tSpine-chilling campaign</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tAuthentic World War II weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tPlayer progression and weapon modification</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022\tSlay alone or with a friend</p>","developers":["Rebellion","Xtended Realities"],"drm_notice":"Denuvo Anti-tamper<br>5 different machines within 24 hours machine activation limit machine activation limit","genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2058030/header.jpg